WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Speaking needs courage — start by whispering.. Did you study today? Then today

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
you won.. Your exam date is a calendar, not an enemy.. One sentence a day is

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
three hundred and sixty-five a year.. Your vocabulary notebook is your most

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
loyal friend.. Success is doing today what you kept postponing.. Let your goal

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
be beating yourself, not a band score.. On hard days even the shortest study

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
still counts.. Put on your headphones; let the world be English for a while..

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
Aim for clear speech, not a perfect accent..
